{"version":1,"page":{"kind":"annotation-detail","href":"/shijing/annotation/075-zi-yi/chengjunying-jiangjianyuan-zhuxi","dataHref":"/__data/shijing/annotation/075-zi-yi/chengjunying-jiangjianyuan-zhuxi/data.json","title":"詩經注析 · 緇衣 · 注释总览","description":"風 · 鄭風 · 緇衣 · 汇集《詩經注析》关于《緇衣》的 1 条注释，含 1 条注脚。"},"payload":{"detail":{"route":{"poemId":"075-zi-yi","materialId":"chengjunying-jiangjianyuan-zhuxi"},"href":"/shijing/annotation/075-zi-yi/chengjunying-jiangjianyuan-zhuxi","poem":{"id":"075-zi-yi","title":"緇衣","categoryId":"feng","subcategoryId":"zhengfeng","path":["風","鄭風","緇衣"],"segments":[{"id":"seg-001","text":"缁衣之宜兮","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-002","text":"敝予又改为兮","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-003","text":"适子之馆兮","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-004","text":"还予授子之粲兮","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-005","text":"缁衣之好兮","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-006","text":"敝予又改造兮","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-007","text":"适子之馆兮","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-008","text":"还予授子之粲兮","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-009","text":"缁衣之席兮","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-010","text":"敝予又改作兮","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-011","text":"适子之馆兮","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-012","text":"还予授子之粲兮","isActive":true}]},"material":{"id":"chengjunying-jiangjianyuan-zhuxi","title":"詩經注析","authors":["程俊英","蔣見元"],"contributorLine":"现代 · 程俊英、蔣見元","era":"现代","publicationYear":1991,"carrier":"PDF"},"stats":{"annotationCount":1,"glossCount":1},"annotations":[{"id":"0001","order":1,"total":1,"layer":"span","layerLabel":"诗句片段","targetText":"缁衣之宜兮，敝予又改为兮。适子之馆兮，还予授子之粲兮。缁衣之好兮，敝予又改造兮。适子之馆兮，还予授子之粲兮。缁衣之席兮，敝予又改作兮。适子之馆兮，还予授子之粲兮。","targetNotes":"全篇题解与注释。","sourceLabel":"第 170-171 页","sourceNotes":"据 /private/tmp/075-cheng2/p195.png、p196.png 定位。","notes":null,"glosses":[{"key":"0001-1","attributionLabel":"程俊英","sectionLabel":"题解","text":"程俊英解《缁衣》为赠衣诗，作者可能是卿大夫妻或贵族妇女，不取美郑武公、庄公之说。她并依次训“缁”为黑色衣，“敝”为坏，“宜”为适合合身，“造”与“作”相同，“席”为大，认为此诗以复沓句式写出亲密明白如话的语气。","notes":null}]}]}}}
